    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Premium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Intervals</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sweep line</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Heap</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/meeting-rooms-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 253</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Meeting Rooms II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Rooms needed = the largest number of meetings running at the same moment. Sort the start times and the end times separately and sweep: a start before the earliest unfinished end opens a room, otherwise it takes that freed room. O(n log n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
